{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":13,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 13:1"},"A wise son ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["heareth"]}," his father’s instruction: but a scorner heareth not rebuke. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 13:2"},"A man shall eat good by the fruit of ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," mouth: but the soul of the transgressors ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall eat"]}," violence. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 13:3"},"He that keepeth his mouth keepeth his life: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," he that openeth wide his lips shall have destruction. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 13:4"},"The soul of the sluggard desireth, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["hath"]}," nothing: but the soul of the diligent shall be made fat. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 13:5"},"A righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," hateth lying: but a wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," is loathsome, and cometh to shame. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 13:6"},"Righteousness keepeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["him that is"]}," upright in the way: but wickedness overthroweth the sinner. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 13:7"},"There is that maketh himself rich, yet ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["hath"]}," nothing: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," that maketh himself poor, yet ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["hath"]}," great riches. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 13:8"},"The ransom of a man’s life ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," his riches: but the poor heareth not rebuke. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 13:9"},"The light of the righteous rejoiceth: but the lamp of the wicked shall be put out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 13:10"},"Only by pride cometh contention: but with the well advised ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"wisdom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 13:11"},"Wealth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["gotten"]}," by vanity shall be diminished: but he that gathereth by labour shall increase. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 13:12"},"Hope deferred maketh the heart sick: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when"]}," the desire cometh, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," a tree of life. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 13:13"},"Whoso despiseth the word shall be destroyed: but he that feareth the commandment shall be rewarded. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 13:14"},"The law of the wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 13:15"},"Good understanding giveth favour: but the way of transgressors ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," hard. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 13:16"},"Every prudent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," dealeth with knowledge: but a fool layeth open ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," folly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 13:17"},"A wicked messenger falleth into mischief: but a faithful ambassador ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," health. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 13:18"},"Poverty and shame ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be to"]}," him that refuseth instruction: but he that regardeth reproof shall be honoured. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 13:19"},"The desire accomplished is sweet to the soul: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," abomination to fools to depart from evil. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 13:20"},"He that walketh with wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," shall be wise: but a companion of fools shall be destroyed. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 13:21"},"Evil pursueth sinners: but to the righteous good shall be repaid. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 13:22"},"A good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," leaveth an inheritance to his children’s children: and the wealth of the sinner is laid up for the just. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 13:23"},"Much food ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is in"]}," the tillage of the poor: but there is ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that is"]}," destroyed for want of judgment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 13:24"},"He that spareth his rod hateth his son: but he that loveth him chasteneth him betimes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 13:25"},"The righteous eateth to the satisfying of his soul: but the belly of the wicked shall want. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 13:25"}]}]}
